  m_text: 32 Cards is a card game based on luck, inspired by Andar Bahar. It is played
    with a deck of 32 cards and 4 bet options, with the goal being to bet on an option
    with the highest score. Each bet option starts with one card by default, with
    an additional card added only after a bet has been placed on it.
